    "Split the candidates' 'Sensorimotor Battery' into the distinct behavioural paradigms actually run (visual object response, visual placing response, acoustic response, tactile reflex battery, core/surface temperature, tail pinch). Each measures a different behavioural/physiological construct with its own apparatus and outcome and is reported separately by the paper.",
