    "B1 for visual object response scored as 2-3 (frontal + lateral subtests combined into overall score; two distinct sub-measures reported).",
    "D2 for visual placing (70 min) and tail pinch (70 min) scored 2 (61 min–6 h) per the rubric cutoff (>60 min); visual object, acoustic, tactile, and core temperature scored 1 (≤60 min).",
    "C2 setup_habituation set to 'yes' across assays because animals were trained 2x/week for 2 weeks on the test battery before pharmacological treatment.",
    "setup_restrain set to 'yes' for visual placing (tail suspension) and core temperature (rectal probe insertion); 'no' for the other freely-moving tests."
